<view class="page">
  <view class="balance-card">
    <view class="label">当前余额</view>
    <view class="amount">¥{{balanceTotal}}</view>
    <view class="sub">本金 ¥{{balancePrincipal}} · 赠送 ¥{{balanceGift}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section">
    <view class="title">选择充值档位</view>
    <view
      class="pkg {{selectedId === item.id ? 'on' : ''}}"
      a:for="{{packages}}"
      a:key="id"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      onTap="onSelect"
    >
      <view class="pkg-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="pkg-meta">实付 ¥{{item.pay_amount}} · 到账 ¥{{item.credit_total}}</view>
    </view>
    <view a:if="{{!packages.length}}" class="empty">暂无可用档位</view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn-primary" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{!selectedId}}" onTap="submit">确认充值</button>
  <button class="btn-ghost mini" a:if="{{canSubscribeBalanceLow}}" loading="{{subscribeLoading}}" disabled="{{subscribeLoading}}" onTap="subscribeBalanceLow">订阅余额提醒</button>
  <view class="rules">
    <view class="rules-title">储值说明</view>
    <view class="tip">· 到账金额 = 本金 + 赠送，支付成功后立即可用于本店点餐结算。</view>
    <view class="tip">· 扣减顺序：赠送金优先，再扣本金；余额支付不计二次营收。</view>
    <view class="tip">· 适用门店：以当前选中/扫码门店为准；跨店是否通用以门店规则为准。</view>
    <view class="tip">· 有效期：余额长期有效，除非门店另行公告。</view>
    <view class="tip">· 退款：充值成功后原则上不支持原路退回；未消费余额如需处理请到店联系店员。</view>
  </view>
</view>
